ent}} · {{d.title}}</small><em>{{d.summary}}</em></span><b>查看介绍 →</b></button></div><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">HEALTH NOTES</p><h2>健康资讯</h2></div><button class="section-link" @click="go('/healthNews')">查看全部 →</button></div><div class="info-gallery" @click="go('/healthNews')"><article><img src="/img/info1.png" alt=""><div><strong>关注身体健康</strong><p>通过定期体检了解身体状况。</p></div></article><article><img src="/img/info2.png" alt=""><div><strong>养成健康习惯</strong><p>关爱自己，从日常开始。</p></div></article></div></template>
